            <title>[IGNITE-10444] MVCC: CacheMvccTxFastFinishTest fails.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10444</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Seems, read-only transaction doesn&apos;t creates prepare\finish future as classic tx do.&lt;br/&gt;
