                            <comment id="16751131" author="pavlukhin" created="Thu, 24 Jan 2019 13:39:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Checked that failure reproduces on &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/4ea443ceffa4445003aa5c8448017eb430cedff3&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/4ea443ceffa4445003aa5c8448017eb430cedff3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
